      "description": "Five weather systems on KNOB 6, in fifths: tornado, hurricane, lightning, wildfire, sandstorm. KNOB 5 is the intensity; any pad fires the system on screen's main event (touchdown, eyewall cycle, strike, flare up, gust); sway morphs the system, press squeezes, the hand steers the eye. The rack stays off.",
